Assignment 1: Path & Query Parameters
Objective: Build an endpoint that utilizes both a path parameter and optional query parameters.

Task: Create a FastAPI application with a route: /catalog/{category}/items/{item_id}.

Requirements:

category (path parameter) must be a string.

item_id (path parameter) must be an integer with validation ensuring it is greater than 0 (ge=1).

Add two query parameters: include_reviews (boolean, defaulting to false) and tag (optional string, maximum length of 20 characters).

Return a dictionary echoing back all parameters received.

Assignment 2: CRUD Routing & HTTP Methods
Objective: Implement multiple HTTP methods on a resource collection.

Task: Create a resource router for /books supporting four standard operations:

GET /books/ - Returns a list of books (supports optional query parameters limit and offset for pagination).

POST /books/ - Simulates creating a new book.

PUT /books/{book_id} - Simulates updating an existing book by its integer ID.

DELETE /books/{book_id} - Simulates deleting a book by its integer ID